liday season.\n- Snap (NYSE:SNAP) shares were up some 22% to $8.56 as earnings and revenue beat estimates . Daily active users also edged above forecasts .\n- Chipmaker Skyworks Solutions (NASDAQ:SWKS) shares jumped 5.7% to $80.27 despite missing estimates for revenue and earnings. The company announced a $2 billion stock buyback program.\n- Gamemaker Electronic Arts (NASDAQ:EA) shares plunged 17.3% after hours after fiscal-third-quarter earnings and revenue missed estimates . The company also trimmed its guidance.\n- Spirit Airlines (NYSE:SAVE) shares fell 2.2% to $61.54 after hours, even as revenue beat estimates and earnings were in line.\n- Tableau Software (NYSE:DATA), the Seattle-based maker of visualization software, saw shares fall 3.7% to $128 even as results beat estimates from analysts polled by Investing.com. Its guidance for first-quarter revenue looked a little light, with the top of its range right at the forecasts compiled by Refinitiv.\n- Apple (NASDAQ:AAPL) slipped after hours to $174.02 on word that retail chief Angela Ahrendts will leave the company on April 1.\nRelated Articles\nNVIDIA Rises 3%\nFrench, German farmers destroy crops after GMOs found in Bayer seeds\nStocks - Wall Street Flat After GM Earnings", "external_links": ["https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/china-stocks-higher-at-close-of-trade-shanghai-composite-up-130-1770480?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/equities/snap-inc-earnings?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/snap-beats-on-bottom-top-lines-users-shares-soar-1770128?utm_source=yahoo&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=yahoo_finance", "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/daimler-fourthquarter-tempered-by-weaker-mercedes-earnings-as-tariffs-hit-1770470?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://w